1
00:00:07,300 --> 00:00:08,300
Benny: Five stars! Hooray!

2
00:00:08,900 --> 00:00:09,700
Benny: (giggles)

3
00:00:10,900 --> 00:00:12,400
Kisha: Hold still, little one…

4
00:00:12,600 --> 00:00:13,200
Kisha: Done!

5
00:00:13,300 --> 00:00:15,100
Benny: Are we near the cake stall yet?

6
00:00:15,200 --> 00:00:16,200
Ziggy: Almost. Don't fret!

7
00:00:18,000 --> 00:00:19,600
Benny: That's what you said before!

8
00:00:19,900 --> 00:00:20,800
Kisha: Bye-bye, bug!

9
00:00:21,400 --> 00:00:23,200
Ziggy: You're doing great. Let's explore!

10
00:00:25,100 --> 00:00:28,400
Kids: Hello, Ziggy! Hip, hip, hooray!

11
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:31,500
Benny: Come on, let's play!

12
00:00:32,500 --> 00:00:34,500
Kisha: Oh, what a lovely sight to see…

13
00:00:34,700 --> 00:00:36,400
Kisha: Everybody, smile for me!

14
00:00:37,000 --> 00:00:39,200
Kisha: Thank you, one and all, with glee!

15
00:00:44,800 --> 00:00:46,500
Benny: Oh no! A puddle!

16
00:00:47,700 --> 00:00:48,600
Kisha: What a muddle!

17
00:00:48,900 --> 00:00:50,600
Benny: You could have said!

18
00:00:53,100 --> 00:00:54,000
Kisha: Say cheese!

19
00:00:54,000 --> 00:00:56,200
Kisha: I thought you looked ahead!

20
00:01:02,800 --> 00:01:04,400
Kisha: Aww, birdies… tweet!

21
00:01:06,000 --> 00:01:08,400
Benny: Is there a spot with a view up high,

22
00:01:08,600 --> 00:01:10,400
Benny: to snap the market from the sky?

23
00:01:10,500 --> 00:01:12,000
Benny: Oh, never mind!

24
00:01:14,900 --> 00:01:18,800
Ziggy: Well! Up here, the view's divine!

25
00:01:19,100 --> 00:01:20,600
Kisha: Found a view spot, Ziggy dear?

26
00:01:20,700 --> 00:01:21,700
Ziggy: Yes, right here!

27
00:01:22,800 --> 00:01:25,100
Kisha: Oh no! Here comes the rain!

28
00:01:35,500 --> 00:01:38,200
Kisha: Wow! A rainbow, bright and bold!

29
00:01:38,400 --> 00:01:40,100
Ziggy: Mmm… pure gold.

30
00:01:43,200 --> 00:01:44,300
Benny: Rain all gone?

31
00:01:45,100 --> 00:01:46,300
Benny: Right! Carry on?

32
00:01:46,600 --> 00:01:50,300
Ziggy: Yes! Let's go, the sun is glowing!

33
00:01:51,300 --> 00:01:53,000
Kids: Hi, Ziggy, hi!

34
00:01:53,000 --> 00:01:54,400
Ziggy: Hello! Wave high!

35
00:01:55,200 --> 00:01:56,700
Kisha: Smile, Ziggy, smile!

36
00:01:57,700 --> 00:01:59,600
Benny: Good day so far?

37
00:02:00,000 --> 00:02:00,700
Ziggy: Yes!

38
00:02:01,200 --> 00:02:02,400
Ziggy: Best by a mile!

39
00:02:03,200 --> 00:02:05,100
Kisha: Wow, what a day!

40
00:02:05,100 --> 00:02:08,500
Ziggy: The whole bright day is living here to stay!

41
00:02:09,300 --> 00:02:11,100
Benny: Oh no! My battery's dead!

42
00:02:11,600 --> 00:02:12,500
Kisha: Yep!

43
00:02:13,500 --> 00:02:14,900
Kisha: Even screens need bed!

44
00:02:15,100 --> 00:02:16,500
Benny: Was that all real?

45
00:02:17,000 --> 00:02:17,500
Kisha: Yes!

46
00:02:17,500 --> 00:02:18,500
Benny: Today?!

47
00:02:18,600 --> 00:02:19,500
Kisha: For real!

48
00:02:19,700 --> 00:02:24,000
Benny: I held my screen from dawn till night… and missed the whole day's light!

49
00:02:24,200 --> 00:02:25,500
Benny: What's tomorrow's plan?

50
00:02:26,000 --> 00:02:28,100
Ziggy: Real-life fun. Snap all you can!

51
00:02:29,000 --> 00:02:34,400
Captain Cyber Champ: Hey! When did something great zoom right by… and you almost missed it, 'cause your screen caught your eye?

52
00:02:36,000 --> 00:02:39,300
Captain Cyber Champ: Put it down, look up, and see: the best stuff's right here, for free!

53
00:02:39,500 --> 00:02:42,400
Captain Cyber Champ: Cyber Champions… that's you and me!

